{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDXyiuMUj7un4r99nbKX", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：34 年。** 美国 1776 年 7 月 4 日宣布独立，墨西哥 1810 年 9 月 16 日宣布独立（\"多洛雷斯呼声\"），1810 − 1776 = 34。\n\n有一点要注意：有资料说\"多洛雷斯呼声\"只是起义的号召，不是法律意义上的独立宣言。如果按墨西哥 1821 年签署的正式独立文书算，差距就是 45 年。这个 1821 年的日期是我自己知道的，这次搜索没有查证。按通常的说法，答案是 34 年。\n\n共搜索 2 次。\n\n依据：\n- [Grito de Dolores – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grito_de_Dolores)\n- [Grito de Dolores – Britannica](https://www.britannica.com/event/Grito-de-Dolores)\n- [July 4, 1776 Declaration of Independence – America Comes Alive](https://americacomesalive.com/day_in_history/july-4-1776-declaration-independence/)\n- [For July 4: The Declaration of Independence – Wisconsin Examiner](https://wisconsinexaminer.com/2025/07/04/for-july-4-the-declaration-of-independence/)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 2348, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4290, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 2348}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:03:25.156Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDXyicEucRtby3KNiCjB"}
